  "readOnlyHint": false,
  "title": "Plan a trip"
 },
 "description": "Start a saved Skym planning conversation and its living report from the user's brief. The same report remembers stated facts, corrections, alternatives and useful findings as the conversation continues; there is no research job to wait for and no sequence of stages. Returns trip_id, its private grant, and claim_url. Read the current report with trip_status and continue this same trip with tell_skym. Give claim_url to the user; keep the grant private. A Skinow ?join= invitation link as the brief joins that shared trip instead.",
